{"id": "core-res-multistep-cfg-pp", "name": "RES Multistep CFG++", "family": "sampler", "subfamily": "multistep ODE, exponential, CFG++", "plain": "RES with the CFG++ treatment: first add the guidance gap to x, then run the exponential step on unconditional predictions. History stores U rather than D. The cfg=1 shortcut is off.", "math": "Symbols: x current latent; \u03c3=sigmas[i]; \u03c3'=sigmas[i+1]; D=denoised (x0 prediction after CFG); U=uncond_denoised; d=(x\u2212D)/\u03c3. \nt=\u2212log \u03c3, \u03c6\u2081(z)=(e^z\u22121)/z, \u03c6\u2082(z)=(\u03c6\u2081(z)\u22121)/z. t_d=\u2212log \u03c3_down, h=t_d\u2212t, c\u2082=(t_{i\u22121}\u2212t_old)/h where t_old=\u2212log(previous \u03c3_down). b\u2081=\u03c6\u2081(\u2212h)\u2212\u03c6\u2082(\u2212h)/c\u2082, b\u2082=\u03c6\u2082(\u2212h)/c\u2082 (NaN\u21920).\n\u03c3_down=\u03c3'. First step or \u03c3'=0: x'=D+\u03c3'(x\u2212U)/\u03c3. Otherwise x_s=x+(D\u2212U); x'=e^{\u2212h}x_s+h(b\u2081U+b\u2082U_old).", "props": {"order": 2, "stages": "1 (2 network passes, cfg=1 shortcut off)", "stochastic": "deterministic", "multistep": true, "prediction_space": "x0 in \u2212log \u03c3, from U", "final_sigma0": "Explicit: Euler branch gives x'=D at \u03c3'=0.", "flow_const": "No CONST branch."}, "evidence": [{"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1531", "symbol": "sample_res_multistep_cfg_pp"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1483", "symbol": "disable_cfg1_optimization"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1494", "symbol": "sigma_down"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1510", "symbol": "uncond_denoised"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1511", "symbol": "uncond_denoised"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1520", "symbol": "old_denoised"}], "providers": [{"pack": "core", "author": "Comfy Org and contributors", "licence": "GPL-3.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["KSampler", "KSamplerAdvanced", "KSamplerSelect"], "note": "", "verdict": ""